# Master Prompt

If `master-prompt.md` exists at the repo root, read it at session start and
follow its instructions for the task it describes.

- It is local-only (gitignored). Never commit, print, or paste it elsewhere.
- Its brand rules apply to any page work it covers: no hardcoded brand
  names in visible copy; resolve names per request via `getBrand()` /
  `useBrand()`; no company-name env vars; no hostname conditionals in pages.
- Prefer server components; keep `/terms` and `/privacy` rendering directly.
- Before finishing, verify its acceptance criteria (typecheck + grep proving
  no hardcoded names) and report files changed, helpers used, and results.
